# ncurses: newterm(vt100) + box + text + reverse video. The oracle is the SAME test
# against the SAME ncurses 6.5 source configured identically, built for Linux on the
# host (etc/curs-linux.out = its stdout, byte-exact escape sequences).
curstest|0|/bin/curstest|curstest
@curstest|^CURSTEST PASS$
@curstest|solnix riscv64 ncurses
@curstest|REVERSE
